c_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows: Xp, Vista, 7, 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1499,"final_formatted":"$14.99 USD","initial":1499,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Cateia Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"true"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"16 Oct, 2019"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cI have to give props to the Cateia Games developers for coming up with such a good product with such a small team, as everything I have seen shows that a lot of efforts went into the product. Despite some technical shortcomings, the game is still a joy from start to finish, so all I can do is give it my highest recommendations.\u201d<br>GOOD GAME! \u2013 diehardgamefan<br><br>\u201cThe developers have created such a compelling world that I really want to delve even deeper into it. And if you are a fan of the old King\u2019s Quest series, or you simply can\u2019t resist the charm of an intriguing fantasy adventure, The Legend of the Crystal Valley is the perfect choice for you.\u201d<br>3.5 / 5 \u2013 adventuregamers<br><br>\u201cLegend of Crystal Valley is a charming game of beginnings and endings, of love and loss, creation and destruction, past and future, and possible vs. impossible. It allows the gamer to meander through a lovely setting accompanied by mellow music while uncovering a beguiling tale all the while solving puzzles which are both fun and fair. I particularly appreciated the varied control schemes available.\u201d<br>4.5 / 5 \u2013 gameboomers<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_45ffbf169c6cd641aa4a1f5d12461c45ce277943.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765882785","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_45ffbf169c6cd641aa4a1f5d12461c45ce277943.600x338.jpg?t=1765882785"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_cf55ca052789506c5cc8be714f5b5a195bb19725.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765882785","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_cf55ca052789506c5cc8be714f5b5a195bb19725.600x338.jpg?t=1765882785"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_edf87b88f414139fc51ba7eb91d3b42ebcae804d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765882785","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_edf87b88f414139fc51ba7eb91d3b42ebcae804d.600x338.jpg?t=1765882785"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_0a40b4906e4219ae8af6376257e063bf49ee7ea4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765882785","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_0a40b4906e4219ae8af6376257e063bf49ee7ea4.600x338.jpg?t=1765882785"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_48a885a8d45f04482f657190b0c19083f913315c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765882785","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_48a885a8d45f04482f657190b0c19083f913315c.600x338.jpg?t=1765882785"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161300/ss_ffaafe645d84ea8f2ec24e805434c3c628b7491d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765882785","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste